{"ok": true, "summary": "The model uses a 110 × 90 × 3 mm base, a 3 mm microchannel layer and a 2 mm lid, with 8 mm-bore ports at opposite short ends. A 90 × 84 mm fin field contains 140 physical fins at 0.6 mm pitch, displayed as 56 equivalent fins preserving total fin volume and open width. Copper, aluminium and diamond-copper bases are compared at the specified conductivities, retaining an aluminium fin core, lid and ports. Resistance assumes uniform 1200 W heat input across the full base footprint; it excludes convection, interfaces and spreading. Composite density and raw-material price are assumed at 6000 kg/m³ and 1500 CNY/kg. A bonded core and lid are assumed; pressure integrity and manufacturing feasibility require validation.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>1200 W GPU cold plate</title>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}\n.line{margin:2px 0}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:3px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;right:10%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:16px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>1200 W GPU cold plate</h3>\n<div class=\"line\">Body: 110 × 90 × 8 mm; ports: Ø8 bore</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Base / fins / lid: 3 / 3 / 2 mm</div>\n<div class=\"line\">140 fins → 56 volume-equivalent fins</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><label>Base: <select id=\"material\"><option value=\"0\">Copper</option><option value=\"1\">Aluminium</option><option value=\"2\">Diamond-copper</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"result\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"thermal\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Cu <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Al <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#707d89\"></span>Diamond-Cu</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Coolant; estimates exclude flow resistance</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Geometry in mm; conductivities in W/(m·K), density in kg/m³, prices in CNY/kg.\n  length:110,width:90,base:3,finHeight:3,lid:2,\n  fieldLength:90,fieldWidth:84,finWidth:0.3,pitch:0.6,displayFins:56,\n  endWall:3,portBore:8,portOuter:12,portLength:12,heat:1200,\n  // The fixed core, lid and external port stubs are aluminium.\n  coreDensity:2700,corePrice:21,\n  materials:[\n    {name:'Copper',k:400,density:8960,price:75,color:'#b87333'},\n    {name:'Aluminium',k:200,density:2700,price:21,color:'#d4d9e0'},\n    {name:'Diamond-copper',k:700,density:6000,price:1500,color:'#707d89'}\n  ],\n  // Unpriced bonds, seals and machining are excluded; composite price is illustrative.\n  explodeBase:8,explodeLid:16\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Rendering error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry{\n  const area=P.length*P.width*1e-6;\n  const baseVolume=P.length*P.width*P.base;\n  const physicalFins=Math.round(P.fieldWidth/P.pitch);\n  const finVolume=physicalFins*P.finWidth*P.finHeight*P.fieldLength;\n  const innerLength=P.length-2*P.endWall;\n  const wallVolume=(P.length*P.width-innerLength*P.fieldWidth)*P.finHeight;\n  // Each end passage intersects the 3 mm-high frame in a circular segment.\n  const r=P.portBore/2,h=P.finHeight/2;\n  const openingArea=2*(h*Math.sqrt(r*r-h*h)+r*r*Math.asin(h/r));\n  const portVolume=2*Math.PI/4*(P.portOuter**2-P.portBore**2)*P.portLength;\n  const lidVolume=P.length*P.width*P.lid;\n  const coreVolume=finVolume+wallVolume-2*openingArea*P.endWall+lidVolume+portVolume;\n  const coreMass=coreVolume*1e-9*P.coreDensity;\n  const rows=P.materials.map(m=>{\n    const baseMass=baseVolume*1e-9*m.density;\n    const resistance=P.base*1e-3/(m.k*area);\n    return {...m,baseMass,totalMass:baseMass+coreMass,resistance,\n      rise:P.heat*resistance,cost:baseMass*m.price+coreMass*P.corePrice};\n  });\n  const triple=(key,digits)=>rows.map(m=>m[key].toFixed(digits)).join(' / ');\n  const metrics=[\n    {label:'Base mass: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu',value:triple('baseMass',4),unit:'kg',note:'Composite density assumed 6000 kg/m³'},\n    {label:'Dry mass: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu',value:triple('totalMass',4),unit:'kg',note:'Fixed Al core, lid, ports; no bonds'},\n    {label:'Base resistance: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu',value:triple('resistance',6),unit:'K/W',note:'1-D conduction over 110 × 90 mm'},\n    {label:'Base temperature rise: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu',value:triple('rise',3),unit:'K',note:'1200 W; excludes convection and TIM'},\n    {label:'Raw cost: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu',value:triple('cost',2),unit:'CNY',note:'Assumed prices: 75/21/1500 CNY/kg'},\n    {label:'Raw cost premium versus Al: Cu / diamond-Cu',value:[rows[0].cost-rows[1].cost,rows[2].cost-rows[1].cost].map(v=>v.toFixed(2)).join(' / '),unit:'CNY',note:'No machining, bonding, scrap or margin'}\n  ];\n  window.__metrics=metrics;\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(100,180,100);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const baseGroup=new THREE.Group(),coreGroup=new THREE.Group(),lidGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(baseGroup,coreGroup,lidGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:.85,roughness:.35});\n  const baseMat=metal(P.materials[0].color),alMat=metal('#d4d9e0');\n  const fluidMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#3b82f6',metalness:0,roughness:.6,transparent:true,opacity:.55,depthWrite:false});\n  function box(x,y,z,px,py,pz,mat,parent){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(x,y,z),mat);\n    mesh.position.set(px,py,pz);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  box(P.length,P.base,P.width,0,P.base/2,0,baseMat,baseGroup);\n  box(P.length,P.lid,P.width,0,P.base+P.finHeight+P.lid/2,0,alMat,lidGroup);\n  const cy=P.base+P.finHeight/2;\n  const side=(P.width-P.fieldWidth)/2;\n  for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n    box(P.length,P.finHeight,side,0,cy,sign*(P.width/2-side/2),alMat,coreGroup);\n    // End walls follow the round opening within the thin channel layer.\n    for(const half of [-1,1]){\n      const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n      shape.moveTo(half*P.fieldWidth/2,-h);\n      shape.lineTo(half*Math.sqrt(r*r-h*h),-h);\n      for(let i=1;i<=24;i++){\n        const yy=-h+2*h*i/24;\n        shape.lineTo(half*Math.sqrt(r*r-yy*yy),yy);\n      }\n      shape.lineTo(half*P.fieldWidth/2,h);shape.closePath();\n      const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:P.endWall,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n      const wall=new THREE.Mesh(geo,alMat);\n      wall.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;\n      wall.position.set(sign>0?P.length/2-P.endWall:-P.length/2,cy,0);\n      coreGroup.add(wall);\n    }\n    const ring=new THREE.Shape();\n    ring.absarc(0,0,P.portOuter/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,r,0,Math.PI*2,true);ring.holes.push(hole);\n    const stub=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(ring,{depth:P.portLength,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:32}),alMat);\n    stub.rotation.y=sign*Math.PI/2;stub.position.set(sign*P.length/2,cy,0);coreGroup.add(stub);\n    const water=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(r,r,P.portLength,32),fluidMat);\n    water.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;water.position.set(sign*(P.length/2+P.portLength/2),cy,0);coreGroup.add(water);\n  }\n  const equivalentPitch=P.fieldWidth/P.displayFins;\n  const equivalentWidth=physicalFins*P.finWidth/P.displayFins;\n  const fins=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.fieldLength,P.finHeight,equivalentWidth),alMat,P.displayFins);\n  const matrix=new THREE.Matrix4();\n  for(let i=0;i<P.displayFins;i++){\n    matrix.makeTranslation(0,cy,-P.fieldWidth/2+(i+.5)*equivalentPitch);\n    fins.setMatrixAt(i,matrix);\n  }\n  fins.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;fins.computeBoundingSphere();coreGroup.add(fins);\n  const gaps=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.fieldLength,P.finHeight,equivalentPitch-equivalentWidth),fluidMat,P.displayFins-1);\n  for(let i=0;i<P.displayFins-1;i++){\n    matrix.makeTranslation(0,cy,-P.fieldWidth/2+(i+1)*equivalentPitch);gaps.setMatrixAt(i,matrix);\n  }\n  gaps.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;gaps.computeBoundingSphere();coreGroup.add(gaps);\n  for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n    const edge=(equivalentPitch-equivalentWidth)/2;\n    box(P.fieldLength,P.finHeight,edge,0,cy,sign*(P.fieldWidth/2-edge/2),fluidMat,coreGroup);\n    const header=(innerLength-P.fieldLength)/2;\n    box(header,P.finHeight,P.fieldWidth,sign*(P.fieldLength/2+header/2),cy,0,fluidMat,coreGroup);\n  }\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(200,20,0xd7d2ca,0xe6e1da);grid.position.y=-.2;scene.add(grid);\n  const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  function fit(){\n    const halfAngle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20),Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20))*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(halfAngle)/.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  let section=false,exploded=false;\n  const plane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=e=>{\n    section=!section;\n    for(const mat of [baseMat,alMat,fluidMat]){mat.clippingPlanes=section?[plane]:[];mat.needsUpdate=true;}\n    e.target.textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=e=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;baseGroup.position.y=exploded?-P.explodeBase:0;\n    lidGroup.position.y=exploded?P.explodeLid:0;e.target.textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;};\n  function selectMaterial(){\n    const m=rows[Number(document.getElementById('material').value)];\n    baseMat.color.set(m.color);\n    document.getElementById('result').textContent=`Dry mass ${m.totalMass.toFixed(4)} kg; raw cost ${m.cost.toFixed(2)} CNY`;\n    document.getElementById('thermal').textContent=`k ${m.k} W/(m·K); R ${m.resistance.toFixed(6)} K/W; ΔT ${m.rise.toFixed(3)} K`;\n  }\n  document.getElementById('material').onchange=selectMaterial;selectMaterial();\n  Object.assign(window,{__scene:scene,__camera:camera,__renderer:renderer,__controls:controls,__model:modelGroup});\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();\n  });\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n}catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Base mass: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu", "value": "0.2661 / 0.0802 / 0.1782", "unit": "kg", "note": "Composite density assumed 6000 kg/m³"}, {"label": "Dry mass: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu", "value": "0.3615 / 0.1756 / 0.2736", "unit": "kg", "note": "Fixed Al core, lid, ports; no bonds"}, {"label": "Base resistance: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu", "value": "0.000758 / 0.001515 / 0.000433", "unit": "K/W", "note": "1-D conduction over 110 × 90 mm"}, {"label": "Base temperature rise: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu", "value": "0.909 / 1.818 / 0.519", "unit": "K", "note": "1200 W; excludes convection and TIM"}, {"label": "Raw cost: Cu / Al / diamond-Cu", "value": "21.96 / 3.69 / 269.30", "unit": "CNY", "note": "Assumed prices: 75/21/1500 CNY/kg"}, {"label": "Raw cost premium versus Al: Cu / diamond-Cu", "value": "18.28 / 265.62", "unit": "CNY", "note": "No machining, bonding, scrap or margin"}], "suggestions": ["Estimate coolant temperature rise and pressure drop at 2 L/min using the physical microchannels.", "Include a 30 × 30 mm GPU footprint, spreading resistance and thermal interface resistance.", "Compare all-copper and all-aluminium constructions, including machining, bonding and corrosion mitigation."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe model uses a 110 × 90 × 3 mm base, a 3 mm microchannel layer and a 2 mm lid, with 8 mm-bore ports at opposite short ends. A 90 × 84 mm fin field contains 140 physical fins at 0.6 mm pitch, displayed as 56 equivalent fins preserving total fin volume and open width. Copper, aluminium and diamond-copper bases are compared at the specified conductivities, retaining an aluminium fin core, lid and ports. Resistance assumes uniform 1200 W heat input across the full base footprint; it excludes convection, interfaces and spreading. Composite density and raw-material price are assumed at 6000 kg/m³ and 1500 CNY/kg. A bonded core and lid are assumed; pressure integrity and manufacturing feasibility require validation.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>1200 W GPU cold plate</title>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}\n.line{margin:2px 0}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:3px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;right:10%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:16px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>1200 W GPU cold plate</h3>\n<div class=\"line\">Body: 110 × 90 × 8 mm; ports: Ø8 bore</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Base / fins / lid: 3 / 3 / 2 mm</div>\n<div class=\"line\">140 fins → 56 volume-equivalent fins</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><label>Base: <select id=\"material\"><option value=\"0\">Copper</option><option value=\"1\">Aluminium</option><option value=\"2\">Diamond-copper</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"result\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"thermal\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Cu <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Al <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#707d89\"></span>Diamond-Cu</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Coolant; estimates exclude flow resistance</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Geometry in mm; conductivities in W/(m·K), density in kg/m³, prices in CNY/kg.\n  length:110,width:90,base:3,finHeight:3,lid:2,\n  fieldLength:90,fieldWidth:84,finWidth:0.3,pitch:0.6,displayFins:56,\n  endWall:3,portBore:8,portOuter:12,portLength:12,heat:1200,\n  // The fixed core, lid and external port stubs are aluminium.\n  coreDensity:2700,corePrice:21,\n  materials:[\n    {name:'Copper',k:400,density:8960,price:75,color:'#b87333'},\n    {name:'Aluminium',k:200,density:2700,price:21,color:'#d4d9e0'},\n    {name:'Diamond-copper',k:700,density:6000,price:1500,color:'#707d89'}\n  ],\n  // Unpriced bonds, seals and machining are excluded; composite price is illustrative.\n  ex